        medium: "Understands turn-up scoring. Begs when having no trumps. Tries to save partner's Tens.",
        hard: "Simulates the 'Major Revoke' risk. Tracks the probability of an opponent holding a 'lone' Jack to execute a 'Hang Jack' play.",
      },
      considerations: [
        'AI engine must support anti-clockwise turn order.',
        'Point hierarchy (H-L-J-G) must be used to evaluate winning moves in the endgame.',
      ],
